Q: Variables not getting passed A: <p>I just made the function be all pointers and it seemed to work</p>
<pre class="lang-none prettyprint-override"><code>Vector2 testVector;
testVector.x = 10;
testVector.y = 20;
Vector2 testVector2;
testVector2.x = 10;
testVector2.y = 40;
Vector2 Velocity;
Velocity.x = 0;
Velocity.y = 0;
TargetVelocity(&amp;testVector, &amp;testVector2, &amp;Velocity);
</code></pre>
<p>This is the output i got which is correct:</p>
<pre class="lang-none prettyprint-override"><code>AX(10) AY(20)                                                                   
